# Veteran Ice Climber ({1}{U}, 1/3): vigilance, can't be blocked, and "Whenever this creature attacks, up to one target player mills
# cards equal to this creature's power." Cast on turn 1; on turn 3 it attacks and Bot1 targets Bot2, who mills one card (its power).
# Bot2's Ornithopter cannot block it (the refusal). It has vigilance, so it is not tapped by attacking.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Veteran Ice Climber
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Veteran Ice Climber.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Veteran Ice Climber)
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Veteran Ice Climber)

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 1
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Veteran Ice Climber.Tapped = false
